{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten ruins and ancient temples on a dark journey of survival and adventure. In Eternal Decay Souls, you will face vicious enemies, avoid deadly traps and uncover ancient secrets as you progress through challenging maps in search of demonic portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect relics, activate portals and face the Dark Guardian at the final portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple, but the journey is far from easy: find the portals, defeat corrupted creatures and face the dark power that dominates these forgotten lands. Locked doors require hidden keys, platforms rely on distant levers, and each area holds dangers that will test your courage and wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Progress through maps with main paths and alternate routes filled with secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combat: Face a variety of enemies with unique patterns and brutal bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Traps: Activate ancient mechanisms and avoid traps to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Evolution: Unlock skills, increase your attributes and become stronger with each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and Resources: Find coins, useful items and upgrades hidden throughout the map.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583680?t=1768257370","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583680?t=1768257370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583680/4b4e401adba6b804c23775a3ccec13bf5ba4085f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768257370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583680/4b4e401adba6b804c23775a3ccec13bf5ba4085f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768257370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"d